{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you will run a colony of fairies. Your relationships with your human neighbors are complicated. On one hand, you rely on their resources (mainly their dreams) to grow. On the other hand, their expansion will eventually overrun you.  <br><br>To survive, you will need to collect enough resources to open a portal and escape.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467750/extras/a04458a6caad402a99e72f37c0ebafaa.avif?t=1770807894\" width=1116 height=550 /></span><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a turn-based game focused on land and resource management.  <br><br>You have the means to slow down the human expansion, but you have to keep a balance. Hindering them too much will halt your own development. Letting them loose will cause them to grow exponentially and eliminate you. <br><br>Over time, you will be able to collect special cards to help you build your permanent palace. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467750/extras/2414911e90bbefdce7d34ead5f06c636.avif?t=1770807894\" width=806 height=326 /></span><strong>Cards</strong><br><br>When humans complete certain structures, you will gain cards. Those cards will provide more resources and let you unlock more options. Unused cards in your deck are carried between levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467750/extras/624cd61b92712c85d50b79bd7a67c0f3.avif?t=1770807894\" width=712 height=160 /></span><strong>Current State of Development</strong><br><br>A demo showing the basic gameplay is available.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3467750?t=1770807894","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3467750?t=1770807894","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467750/1b45bbb8395f953aa31fd21c2460ee8971daeadf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770807894","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467750/1b45bbb8395f953aa31fd21c2460ee8971daeadf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770807894","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"While the game itself is not about adult themes, it is hinted in some of the flavor text like. This includes hints for horror, erotica and alcohol consumption."},"demos":[{"appid":3549680,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you will run a colony of fairies. Your relationships with your human neighbors are complicated. On one hand, you rely on their resources (mainly their dreams) to grow. On the other hand, their expansion will eventually overrun you.  <br><br>To survive, you will need to collect enough resources to open a portal and escape.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467750/extras/a04458a6caad402a99e72f37c0ebafaa.avif?t=1770807894\" width=1116 height=550 /></span><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a turn-based game focused on land and resource management.  <br><br>You have the means to slow down the human expansion, but you have to keep a balance. Hindering them too much will halt your own development. Letting them loose will cause them to grow exponentially and eliminate you. <br><br>Over time, you will be able to collect special cards to help you build your permanent palace. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467750/extras/2414911e90bbefdce7d34ead5f06c636.avif?t=1770807894\" width=806 height=326 /></span><strong>Cards</strong><br><br>When humans complete certain structures, you will gain cards. Those cards will provide more resources and let you unlock more options. Unused cards in your deck are carried between levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467750/extras/624cd61b92712c85d50b79bd7a67c0f3.avif?t=1770807894\" width=712 height=160 /></span><strong>Current State of Development</strong><br><br>A demo showing the basic gameplay is available.</p>","developers":["Wooltyranny"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467750/e7e497f6d494ac0fd30c461d85f7ec3395a8d8da/header.jpg?t=1770807894","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3467750/2011661114/55bd2f5f7d0ee20b60f10ffb4787a76751e8b952/1770804657/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770807893","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3467750/2011661114/55bd2f5f7d0ee20b60f10ffb4787a76751e8b952/1770804657/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770807893","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3467750/2011661114/55bd2f5f7d0ee20b60f10ffb4787a76751e8b952/1770804657/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770807893","id":257284261,"name":"Fairysite Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257284261/5e4f3441a065c9b9f08b3381fbe7b3c8f7fc1566/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1770807893"}],"name":"Fairysite","package_grou